# Files Docker never sends to a build (the build context is the repo root).
# The Dockerfiles also copy only the folders they need; this list is the second safety net.

# Secrets: never in an image, whatever a COPY line says.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Installed packages: each image runs its own `npm ci` for Linux.
node_modules
**/node_modules

# Git, build output, test output and coverage
.git
dist
**/dist
coverage
**/coverage
e2e/
test-results/
playwright-report/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
*.log

# Not needed by any image
docs/
.github/
server/tests/
shared/tests/
**/README.md
